{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_11_level_main_11-13_beg",
  "groupId": "main_11",
  "stageId": "main_11-13",
  "title": "土地震顫",
  "storyCode": "11-15",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-13_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e89bd7b1959c3545d4d82912b582228a347e8171cdc2c2f9296c9c60a416c122",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這些該死的打不完的反抗軍！從薩迪恩區一路折騰到這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把你們那個又大又猛的鐵東西弄出來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是說自行炮？薩卡茲，我們還有許多士兵在前面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "給他們一個信號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_241",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自行炮的攻擊範圍太大，他們來不及撤退！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_419_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走不掉是他們的事。我們的戰士都知道怎麼在戰場上活命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那邊——可移動的機械源石炮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這......這都什麼玩意兒啊，這根本不是普通炮彈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾也有什麼我沒聽說過的高等研究院嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希爾",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在這麼短的時間內......曼弗雷德是怎麼做到的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "無人機找到操控區域了嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "集中注意力。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "操控區域......操控區域......糟了啊博士，這炮彈附帶的源石技藝對我的無人機有干擾。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我說過了，倫蒂尼姆的系統容易破解，但薩卡茲的巫術很難搞定啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，交給我們吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哇，費斯特！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "按照你說的，我們都準備好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "工程小組會確保無人機暢行無阻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你有主意了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可露希爾小姐，這些自行源石炮都是我們工廠組裝的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那......你該不會是準備現場拆了它吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哈哈，可露希爾小姐，要是我們工程小組都是血魔的話，說不定可以試試。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不過很可惜，我們大多都只是平平無奇的工匠而已。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們只是很熟悉這些用自己的雙手造出來的東西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們知道該怎麼瞄準它們的弱點，為真正強大的戰友們創造機會。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "說到底，這就是我們工程人員能在戰場上發揮的最大作用，不是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這滑索......你準備爬到它背上去？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要控制住它的炮口，無人機就能照常工作，沒錯吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#12$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "理論上是這樣，可這也太冒險了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這是我們之間的合作，可露希爾小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "麻煩你和博士幫我們鎖定最安全的落點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "炮火聲中，費斯特注視著眼前的這片戰場。\n他看到的不再是兇狠的薩卡茲，而是最熟悉不過的流水線旁的機械。大型機械移動的聲響，和他最熟悉的節律也沒什麼分別。\n他會用自己的方式把屬於他們的城市奪回來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呼......我一直很想看看這片戰場上空的風景，這不正是個好機會嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "巨大的機械緩慢地行走在街道上。\n與它龐大的軀幹相比，戰場上的人們，無論是維多利亞人，還是薩卡茲，都是那麼渺小。\n它的腳步無人可擋，它的視線能輕易地熔穿街道。\n它彷彿是這座鋼鐵叢林的主宰。\n可它突然發出一聲悲鳴。\n在它視野的盲區，十幾隻鉤爪飛了過來，牢牢地嵌在了它最脆弱的脖頸處。\n緊跟著，數十個小小的人影順著滑索攀到了它的背上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，我們控制住了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "狙擊手，清理附近的敵人！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "維多利亞雇傭兵",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "明白！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛維希婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "術師們，攻擊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "洛洛",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "看看你，女妖，你甚至不願意讓一滴血液近你的身。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你操控的每一滴血液中都蘊藏著你的巫術。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呵呵......女妖的咒術。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是從什麼時候開始，女妖變成你這副死板無趣的模樣的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我還記得，它們過去是如何披著夜色滑翔，一聲聲地吹響骨哨——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它們用尖銳又哀傷的聲浪哀悼在荒野上迷失的過客，同時卻毫不留情地將漆黑的骨爪刺進這些可憐人的後腦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "女妖，這才是女妖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "它們從來都是血魔最為欣賞的獵手。我們在戰場上並肩作戰，以恐懼為武器，收割那些弱小的敵人的性命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可如今的女妖們已經迷失。你們把真實的自我囚禁在和那些萊塔尼亞的術師差不多的裝束中，老氣橫秋，裝模作樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "血魔，真正的迷失者恐怕是你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "歲月不容抗拒地沖刷著大地，也塑造著大地上的生命。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "為何不低頭看看你自己？你也早就失去了最初的形貌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呵......我又何必在意一副皮囊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這副皮囊，卻和我的法袍一樣，是我們如今行走大地的真實模樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "古老王庭的根鬚早已朽爛，如今的王庭徒具樹冠，卻依舊不肯墜向地面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "多麼荒誕......已死之物仍在從本就貧瘠的土地上攫取養分，從而奪去了所有新生的可能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#9$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這才是你的真實目的嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "笑容從血魔的臉上消失了。在他身側，沸騰的血液安靜了一瞬。\n隱隱的震動從地面傳來，上層地面隨之開始搖晃。\n血液。是血液在行軍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#12$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "幹員們，防禦！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "下方戰場......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他突然意識到自己已在這裡停留太久。這座城防軍指揮塔的弱點並不只有萊托一個。\n當他和血魔的注意都被眼前的“魔王”和舊識吸引時，羅德島和自救軍的人可能正在從另一條路靠近他們想要的情報。\n這才是羅德島的計劃，他們並沒有把握在指揮塔上迅速擊敗他和血魔，他們只是想拖延時間。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我必須......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_395_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "太遲了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "是的，太遲了。他可以用一條胳膊來擺脫阿斯卡綸的糾纏，但真正攔住他的是眼前的血海。\n血魔已經被激怒了。他們被一齊困在了這片戰場上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
