          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "中校......中校！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "維多利亞士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔啊——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "士兵們無法再言語。\n他們跌跌撞撞地走到血魔身前，一股又一股血液正從他們脊柱的位置噴出來，取代了他們的手和腳，替他們聽從命令，迅速地行進。\n他們受到了血魔大君的賜福。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_395_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "動手吧，盡情地動手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "血魔大君",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_410_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "血液不會因為生命的消逝而乾涸，只會隨著你徒勞的動作而更快地奔湧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他的士兵們不再聽從他的命令。\n他看著他們前進，前進，直至走到天台邊緣。\n薩卡茲們的戰鬥幾乎快要摧毀這座塔。他們的眼睛裡都沒有這些處於生死之間的普通士兵。\n士兵們大多數是維多利亞人，和他出身不同，他們甚至直到此刻都不知道他出於什麼目的與薩卡茲做了什麼交易。\n他們只是跟著他走到這裡，跟著他走向懸崖。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他知道自己不該動的。只要他躲在後面，血魔和曼弗雷德就不會急著殺死他。\n可他還是想要抓住那些快要下墜的士兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "黑色......能量束......哈......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......萊托中校。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "從你的眼睛裡......我感受到了痛苦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你認為自己是高盧人。你愛著那個已經逝去的龐大幻影，想要拼命抓住它，把它帶回來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你真的相信薩卡茲許下的諾言嗎？你真的相信......重建高盧的夢想能夠實現嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你很恐懼，中校。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你假裝自己仍有希望......只是因為你不願意面對自己想要逃避戰爭的懦弱。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你逼迫自己相信，這一切犧牲與付出都是為了高盧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是你......忘不了那些受你欺騙、被你引向死亡的士兵的眼神。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你是......他們口中那個......幼小的魔王。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我是你的敵人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊托中校",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#6$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可你現在......拉住了我。你不想看見我就這樣死去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他們叫你魔王，而我看見的......\n只是一個溫柔的孩子啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "劇烈的痛苦突然攫住了她。\n並不是眼前的黎博利做了什麼，也並非來自血魔和曼弗雷德的源石技藝。\n因為這根本就不是攻擊。\n阿米婭，阿米婭。\n有一個聲音正在呼喚她，輕柔得就像雪白的剛剛曬過的羽被。\n阿米婭猛地抬起頭。\n頭頂的天空砸向她，濃厚的陰雲向她湧過來，從頭到腳吞沒了她。\n......宛如一個緊到窒息的擁抱。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#4$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，指揮官，我們重新控制住了自行炮！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "十分鐘......再給我十分鐘，我就能全部搞定了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呼......博士，這幾天以來第一次，我覺得我們搞不好真的能贏。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......可露希爾小姐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "怎麼啦？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我真希望你沒說剛剛那句話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你是懷疑我說出來了就會......就會......哇哇哇博士，什麼情況，我的偵察無人機一下子就全部開始瘋狂發出警報了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你不要不說話啊，你不說話我真的很怕！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等等，那是——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerToken": "npc_10002",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（警告的低鳴）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凱爾希。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "凱爾希回來了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "費斯特",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4072_ironmn_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "凱爾希不是在幫我們拖延......呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#5$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你該不會是想說......食腐者的大軍提前回來了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_411_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他們的行進也許並不會發出聲音。否則的話，不會沒有人注意到他們早已穿過了城牆，跨過了半座城市。\n這腳步聲只是一種信號，透過震顫的地面，抵達戰場上每一個人的心臟。\n目所能及的每一條街道上都站滿了薩卡茲的戰士。\n頭頂雲層垂下的陰影並不能籠罩他們，因為他們就是陰影本身。他們正籠罩著大地。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
